    <key>note</key>
    <string># Adjustment notes

- All legacy marks have been made out of components to reduce the repetition in hinting
- All accent marks have been slightly modified in height and position to align better. This is true in ALL optical sizes

- Numbers (0123456789) (+tf variants) jump at optical size 14 to avoid a form morphing in interim steps (Angled to straight forms), which can look strange.


– symbols – fixed minor spacing errors (tabular forms in the period.tf comma.tf colon.tf)

– tcommaaccent.alt had an incorrect form 
– tcedilla.alt was missing. Added in!
– jdotless.alt jcircumflex.alt added
– t_f t_f.alt – changed the f terminal to be inline with all of the other f components

</string>
